**A complete vertical column of one color causes colors to its right (or left) in the same row span to transform into that vertical color.**

In demo 4:
- 6 columns at 5,6,7,8,9 form a "complete column" (color exists at position 5, 6, 7, 8, and 9 across rows 11-13)
